{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p using exponentiation by squaring.\"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base = 2 % p  # Start with base 2, reduced modulo p\n    exponent = n\n\n    while exponent > 0:\n        if exponent % 2 == 1:\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n        exponent //= 2\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p (be aware of numerics).\n    This function computes 2^n modulo p using the exponentiation by squaring algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n    exponent = n\n\n    while exponent > 0:\n        if exponent & 1:  # If exponent is odd\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n        exponent >>= 1  # exponent = exponent // 2\n\n    return result"}
